	<main id="site-content"><section class="blubee-banner">
    <img src="https://www.bluebinaries.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Become-A-Bluebee-banner.jpg" alt="bluebee">

    <div class="container">
        <div class="blueebee-bannercontnt">
            <h1>JOIN US!</h1>
			<h2>BECOME A <span>BLUEBEE</span></h2>
            <p>Join the force and build the future that keeps us mobile and connected.</p>
<p><a class="commonbtn2" href="#job-posts-container">SEE JOB OPENINGS</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="lifebluebee-sec">
    <div class="container">
        <p>BlueBinaries is a powerhouse of passionate automotive engineers connected through the rhythm of - ‘We Initiate. We Inspire. We Innovate.’</p>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 bluebee-txt">
                <h2>Life at <span>BlueBinaries</span></h2>
                <p>At BlueBinaries, we celebrate life and technology with focus on balance, diversity and future where passion is made integral part of the organization. We have our days starting with purpose and ends with fulfilment with a spectrum of exchanges with our experts, learning platforms and access to knowledge and mentorship mapped to trajectory of growth.</p>
<p>Our rigorous cycles of feedback incorporation and the anonymity of each person’s feedback enables us to respect every word of our employees and constantly improve to nourish the health of our environment.</p>
<p>The BlueBinaries momentum is solely attributed to the aspiration of each one of us to engineer visionary technologies that integrate futuristic intelligence into mobility.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 bluebee-img">
                <img src="https://www.bluebinaries.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/team-1.png" alt="bluebee">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="job-posts" id="job-posts-container">
    <div class="container">
	<div class="job-post-title">
      <h2>Job Openings</h2>
	  <p>Interested in any of the below opportunities, please reach out to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#501331223535222310123c253512393e31223935237e333f3d"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7a391b081f1f08093a38160f1f3813141b08131f0954191517">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>
